  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMJD_YOU LEAD PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall Goal: Empower youth-led civil societies to enhance inclusive governance and provide economic opportunities in districts.
&#xa0;
Specific Objectives: Strengthen CSO capacities, ensuring effective advocacy and support for marginalized youth engagement and empowerment.
&#xa0;
Skills Training Focus: Promote entrepreneurship through targeted skills training, equipping youth with tools to navigate economic landscapes.</narrative>
  </description>
